Package: pulzr-zigbee
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Provides: pulzr-cap-zigbee
Description: Zigbee networks on the gateway's Zigbee radios, on pulzr-edge.
 A coordinator per radio (EmberZNet, Z-Stack or deCONZ), set up, paired and
 backed up from Pulzar Net (https://pulzar-net.github.io/PulzrOS/radio-modules.html).
